  "tokenArchitecture": "Theme = ~35 CSS custom properties: 4 base, 8 brand (4 colours + content), 8 status, 3 radii, 2 size multipliers, border width, depth (0|1), noise (0|1). Components derive everything else with color-mix() in oklab (soft = 8% tint, borders = darker mix). Variants (btn-soft, btn-outline, btn-dash, btn-ghost, btn-link) are recipes over the same --btn-color.",
  "distinctiveness": "Personality from knobs, not from components: the same markup becomes corporate (4px, depth 0), cupcake (pill, 2px border, depth 1) or cyberpunk (0 radius, acid yellow) by swapping ~35 variables. depth and noise as boolean multipliers is unusually clever.",
