    "Use --depth and --noise as 0/1 multipliers inside shadow and texture formulas so one switch changes the material.",
    "Derive soft/hover/border variants with color-mix in oklab from one brand colour.",
    "Global density = one multiplier variable (height = unit x 6/8/10/12/14)."
